{"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOLink"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/Layouts","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/Navigations"],"kind":"mentions"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLink"},{"type":"text","text":" proposes layout with text only or text with icon."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It also proposes layout to navigate forward or backward. The link can be displayed in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"small"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"code":"default","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" size.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Text-only-or-Text-and-icon-layout","type":"heading","text":"Text only or Text and icon layout","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This layout is used to open a link or to display a specific feature (like send feedbacks, show more, …)","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["    \/\/ Text only in small size, in compact density","    MISOLink(text: \"Feedback\", size: .small, density: .compact) { \/* the action to process *\/ }","","    \/\/ From a localizable and a bundle","    MISOLink(LocalizedStringKey(\"feedback_link\"), bundle: Bundle.module, size: .small) { }","","    \/\/ Text and icon in default size","    MISOLink(text: \"Feedback\", image: MISOImage(asset: Image(\"ic_heart\")), size: .default) { }","","    \/\/ Text and icon with raw image (not tinted)","    MISOLink(text: \"Feedback\", image: MISOImage(asset: Image(\"ic_brand\"), renderingMode: .original), size: .default) { }"]},{"anchor":"Navigation-layout","type":"heading","text":"Navigation layout","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This layout is used to navigate backward, forward and outside the app","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["    \/\/ Navigate to next page with link in a small size","    MISOLink(text: \"Feedback\", indicator: .next, size: .small, density: .compact) { \/* the action to process *\/ }","","    \/\/ Navigate to previous page with link in a default size","    MISOLink(text: \"Back\", indicator: .previous, size: .default) { \/* the action to process *\/ }","","    \/\/ Full-width: label stays, chevron anchored to the right \/ left","    MISOLink(text: \"See all\", indicator: .next, isFullWidth: true) { \/* the action to process *\/ }","","    \/\/ Full-width: label stays, indicator anchored to the right \/ left","    MISOLink(text: \"See all\", indicator: .external, isFullWidth: true) { \/* the action to process *\/ }"]},{"anchor":"Colored-Surface","type":"heading","text":"Colored Surface","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If link is placed on colored surface using ","type":"text"},{"code":"MISOColoredSurface","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", the default colors (content text and icon or arrow) are automatically adjusted to switch to monochrom.","type":"text"}]},{"name":"Version","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"2.4.0 (Figma component design version)"}]}],"type":"aside","style":"note"},{"name":"Since","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS 0.11.0"}]}],"type":"aside","style":"note